OL,3,GNEWSABereaved Covid-19 campaigner wants
OL,4,Aaccountability
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose mother died in a care
OL,7,Fhome during the coronavirus pandemic
OL,8,Fhopes decision makers will be held to
OL,9,Faccount as part of a
OL,10,Fgovernment-commissioned inquiry.
OL,12,FDeborah Doyle's mother, Sylvia
OL,13,FGriffiths, died in April 2020 with
OL,14,Fsuspected Covid-19 while she was a
OL,15,Fpatient at a Sunderland care home.
OL,17,FA campaigner with Covid-19 Bereaved
OL,18,FFamilies for Justice UK, Doyle will be
OL,19,Fgoing to London on Tuesday to hear
OL,20,Ffindings from the inquiry regarding the
OL,21,Fpandemic's impact on the care sector.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
