OL,3,GNEWSABereaved Covid-19 campaigner wants
OL,4,Aaccountability
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I hope that there'll be accountability
OL,7,Fand I hope that they will name the
OL,8,Fpeople that made the decisions that we
OL,9,Fknow from lived experience [meant]
OL,10,Fthings went wrong," she said.
